    <string name="analytics_summary">Optional waiting-time statistics to check future forecast accuracy. Declining does not affect tracking or alerts.</string>
    <string name="analytics_consent_body">With your permission, QueueWatch sends the selected checkpoint, vehicle type, positions and observation times, waiting-time estimates, actual call time and random installation and session IDs to the analytics server. This compares the accuracy of two forecasting methods.\n\nData is sent while tracking is active, including in the background. Registration numbers, contacts and GPS coordinates are not sent.\n\nParticipation is optional. You can disable sending at any time without affecting tracking or alerts. Disabling does not delete records already sent.</string>
    <string name="analytics_code">Statistics ID: %1$s</string>
    <string name="analytics_deletion_body">To request deletion of previously sent records, email vasilipylik@gmail.com with this ID. The registration number is not needed. Turning off the switch stops new analytics calculations and sending, and clears pending events on the phone.</string>
