    <string name="welcome_title">Help improve queue accuracy?</string>
    <string name="welcome_body">Participation is selected by default. During tracking, including in the background, QueueWatch can send the checkpoint, vehicle type, positions, observation times, waiting-time calculations and random identifiers to the developer’s analytics server. Vehicle numbers, contacts and GPS are excluded. You can turn this off in Settings. Nothing is sent until you choose.</string>
